 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_4olcy-CAYoQ7kNvwFKa2aw&_nc_oc=Ado4wkmMslmJxAvb06R-UpAwBYBfrMfE2YOWoL06mCaCi7RTSL_EuOsR-Y4NQ2keuQk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxzTvSjCVQfNxYcoHi8Gg1ZscJ-S1Sn7W8R_jJKXGXWA&oe=6AF5D8C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7MgvV67YbVQQ7kNvwGAjKZc&_nc_oc=AdpsCghnWC1gRwBLw9X6mMBmrAlVER2nlZjLE2ZPfu9zPArEPt2Pnfgvig3CQOCm-0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTOZdI_JN7yAGqxkfdJS7tBOHTUorqiEzcW6nbRfFDj_w&oe=6AF5E626"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O9V95Y5qD-UQ7kNvwEejOx7&_nc_oc=AdpIEmK1RIhUE4qEeCUSEdONU3wGn99NkX-IrbsqWXpwqYUawg_OU1HzruJ7m61KqNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9o4nwBm7xcsKDOVIT1by0Wi2PBvJG84RdIFUPRqdreA&oe=6AF5F01C"}, {"fil